{"id":"dergleichen","lemma":"dergleichen","pos":"pron","rank":4762,"glosses":["such","suchlike, the like"],"ipa":"/deːrˈɡlaɪ̯çən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/De-dergleichen.ogg/De-dergleichen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du wirst nichts dergleichen tun!","en":"You'll do no such thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593213","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Nichts dergleichen wird je wieder passieren.","en":"Nothing like that will ever happen again.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"ever"},{"g":"again"},{"g":"to happen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe dergleichen nicht versprochen.","en":"I didn't promise anything like that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"promise","l":"Versprechen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe nie etwas dergleichen geäußert.","en":"I never said any such thing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"something"},null,{"g":"expressed"}]},{"text":"Ich werde nichts dergleichen tun.","en":"I'll do nothing of the sort.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"to do"}]}]}